flowchart TD
    send([Outgoing send or reply]) --> unread{Sender has unread messages?}
    unread -->|Yes| withhold[Withhold draft; return waiting batch as tool result]
    withhold --> read[Next model context reads the batch]
    read --> revise[Agent reconsiders and explicitly retries]
    revise --> unread
    unread -->|No| online{Recipient reachable?}
    online -->|No| reject([Fail clearly; retain no outgoing message])
    online -->|Yes| checkpoint{New unread messages before submission?}
    checkpoint -->|Yes| withhold
    checkpoint -->|No| accept[Accept message in recipient memory]
    accept --> priority{Priority?}
    priority -->|Normal| idle{Recipient idle?}
    idle -->|No| wait[Accumulate in mailbox; not Pi follow-up queue]
    wait --> recipientReply{Recipient attempts outgoing response?}
    recipientReply -->|Yes| recipientCheckpoint[Recipient's reply checkpoint returns whole waiting batch]
    recipientReply -->|No| settle[Wait until recipient becomes idle]
    settle --> batch[Inject waiting messages together, oldest first]
    idle -->|Yes| batch
    priority -->|Urgent| steer[Pi steering at next turn boundary]
    batch --> context[Exact delivered batch reaches model context]
    steer --> context
    recipientCheckpoint --> context
    context --> readInbox[Mark batch read; recipient can revise its response]
    readInbox --> explicit{Explicit reply?}
    explicit -->|Yes| replyCycle[Reply follows the same checkpoint and delivery cycle]
    explicit -->|No| local([Assistant text stays local; no acknowledgment])
    replyCycle --> ack[Sender receives reply; original acknowledged]
    accept -.-> stop[Reload or shutdown discards mailbox and history]

    classDef ok fill:#a6e3a1,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e
    classDef action fill:#f9e2af,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e
    classDef memory fill:#cba6f7,color:#1e1e2e,stroke:#1e1e2e
    class batch,context,ack ok
    class withhold,revise,recipientCheckpoint,reject action
    class accept,wait,stop memory
